                                "text": "For initiation, which is the maturative factor, one ought to seek out and take the four initiations from a master whose lineage of preceptors is intact, whose rites are unconfused, who knows how to arrange the inner and outer correlates, who is able to plant successfully the seeds of the four Buddha-bodies, and who acts in accord with the Buddha's words."
